# Normalize line endings in the repository to LF.
#
# Why: this repo is developed on Windows (core.autocrlf=true) but the lint gate
# runs Prettier, which defaults to LF. Without this file, every checked-in file
# was stored as CRLF and `npm run lint` reported ~14k "Delete `␍`" errors that
# had nothing to do with real code problems. With `eol=lf` the working tree,
# the index and Prettier all agree on LF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Keep Windows-only scripts usable if any are added later.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# Binary assets — never touch.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.wasm binary
